{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "arcgis-picker",
  "title": "ArcGIS Picker Modal",
  "navigationLabel": "ArcGIS Picker Modal",
  "summary": "Browse and select ArcGIS services and layers to link directly to a card — opened from the Card Creation form.",
  "manualPath": "/user-manual?section=arcgis-picker",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "arcgis-picker-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "ArcGIS Picker Modal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "arcgis-picker-002",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The ArcGIS Picker lets you search and select ArcGIS services or individual layers to link to a card. It opens from the "
        },
        {
          "type": "strong",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "+ Link ArcGIS Service / Layer"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "button inside the Card Creation form. Selected items are attached to the card and can be toggled on the map from the Card Detail View."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "arcgis-picker-003",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Opening the Picker"
        }
      ],
      "role": "feature-title"
    },
    {
      "id": "arcgis-picker-004",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Click "
        },
        {
          "type": "strong",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "+ Link ArcGIS Service / Layer"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " inside the Add Card form to open the picker. It loads available services from the database. If the catalog cannot be loaded or is empty, the picker shows no available services instead of a bundled local list."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "arcgis-picker-005",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Search Bar & Navigation"
        }
      ],
      "role": "feature-title"
    },
    {
      "id": "arcgis-picker-006",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Type a keyword and press Enter or click the search button. The type dropdown narrows results to "
        },
        {
          "type": "strong",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Any"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "type": "strong",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Folder"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ","
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "type": "strong",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Service"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", or "
        },
        {
          "type": "strong",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Layer"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ". When multiple matches exist, a counter and Prev/Next arrows appear to jump between them."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "arcgis-picker-007",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Drill-Down Navigation"
        }
      ],
      "role": "feature-title"
    },
    {
      "id": "arcgis-picker-008",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "In navigation mode the root view shows three state tiles (WA, ID, OR). Click a state to see its folders; click a folder to see its services. A breadcrumb bar at the top shows your current path, and the Back button moves you one level up."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "arcgis-picker-009",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Services & Layer Selection"
        }
      ],
      "role": "feature-title"
    },
    {
      "id": "arcgis-picker-010",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Each service row has a checkbox and an expand arrow. Checking the service checkbox selects the whole service. Clicking the row expands it to show individual layers — check individual layers to link only those. Group layers expand recursively with their own checkboxes."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "arcgis-picker-011",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Add & Cancel"
        }
      ],
      "role": "feature-title"
    },
    {
      "id": "arcgis-picker-012",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The footer shows how many items are currently selected. "
        },
        {
          "type": "strong",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Add"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "is enabled once at least one item is selected; clicking it inserts all selected services and layers as linked items in the Card Creation form."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "type": "strong",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Cancel"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " closes the picker without changing the form."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
